@startuml
title UML state chart diagram

state "Initial" as Initial
state "Registration" as Registration
state "Login" as Login
state "Weather Check" as WeatherCheck
state "Location Input" as LocationInput
state "Weather Data Selection" as WeatherDataSelection
state "Display Weather" as DisplayWeather
state "Additional Details" as AdditionalDetails
state "Logout" as Logout
state "Final" as Final

[*] --> Initial
Initial --> Registration : User initiates registration
Initial --> Login : User initiates login

Registration --> Login : Successful registration
Registration --> [*] : Unsuccessful registration

Login --> WeatherCheck : Successful login
Login --> [*] : Unsuccessful login

WeatherCheck --> LocationInput : User requests weather information
LocationInput --> WeatherCheck : Valid location entered
LocationInput --> [*] : Invalid location entered

WeatherCheck --> WeatherDataSelection : Valid location

WeatherDataSelection --> DisplayWeather : User selects weather data
DisplayWeather --> AdditionalDetails : User requests additional details
DisplayWeather --> Logout : User requests logout
AdditionalDetails --> DisplayWeather : User views additional details

Logout --> Final
Final --> [*]

@enduml
